---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Service Areas | Bar Moon Contracting"
  description="Bar Moon Contracting serves Temple, Belton, Salado, Killeen, Harker Heights, Copperas Cove, Jarrell, Nolanville, and rural Bell County, TX."
>
  <Header />
  
  <main class="pt-20 bg-light-neutral text-primary">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
      <img src="/images/fog.jpg" alt="Fog over the landscape in Bell County, Texas" class="w-full aspect-[16/9] object-cover rounded-xl mb-8" width="800" height="450" loading="lazy" />
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">Service Areas</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-700 mb-8 max-w-3xl">
        Bar Moon Contracting is proud to serve homeowners, businesses, churches, and facilities throughout Bell County and the surrounding areas in Central Texas. As a service-area business, we come to you—no public showroom or office address to visit.
      </p>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">Towns We Serve</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-lg">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-accent" /> Temple</div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-accent" /> Belton</div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-accent" /> Salado</div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-accent" /> Killeen</div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-accent" /> Harker Heights</div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-accent" /> Copperas Cove</div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-accent" /> Jarrell</div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-accent" /> Nolanville</div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-accent" /> Morgan's Point Resort</div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-accent" /> Little River-Academy</div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-accent" /> Rogers</div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-accent" /> Holland</div>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-6 text-gray-600">We also cover many rural properties and smaller communities throughout Bell County and the surrounding areas. If you're unsure if we serve your location, just give us a call.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">City service guides</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
          Dedicated general contracting pages for each community we serve (unique local copy, schema, and FAQs):
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-800 columns-1 sm:columns-2 gap-8">
          <li class="mb-2 break-inside-avoid">
            <a href="/services/general-contracting-temple-tx" class="text-accent hover:underline font-medium">Temple</a>
          </li>
          <li class="mb-2 break-inside-avoid">
            <a href="/services/general-contracting-belton-tx" class="text-accent hover:underline font-medium">Belton</a>
          </li>
          <li class="mb-2 break-inside-avoid">
            <a href="/services/general-contracting-salado-tx" class="text-accent hover:underline font-medium">Salado</a>
          </li>
          <li class="mb-2 break-inside-avoid">
            <a href="/services/general-contracting-killeen-tx" class="text-accent hover:underline font-medium">Killeen</a>
          </li>
          <li class="mb-2 break-inside-avoid">
            <a href="/services/general-contracting-harker-heights-tx" class="text-accent hover:underline font-medium">Harker Heights</a>
          </li>
          <li class="mb-2 break-inside-avoid">
            <a href="/services/general-contracting-copperas-cove-tx" class="text-accent hover:underline font-medium">Copperas Cove</a>
          </li>
          <li class="mb-2 break-inside-avoid">
            <a href="/services/general-contracting-jarrell-tx" class="text-accent hover:underline font-medium">Jarrell</a>
          </li>
          <li class="mb-2 break-inside-avoid">
            <a href="/services/general-contracting-nolanville-tx" class="text-accent hover:underline font-medium">Nolanville</a>
          </li>
          <li class="mb-2 break-inside-avoid">
            <a href="/services/general-contracting-morgans-point-resort-tx" class="text-accent hover:underline font-medium">Morgan&apos;s Point Resort</a>
          </li>
          <li class="mb-2 break-inside-avoid">
            <a href="/services/general-contracting-little-river-academy-tx" class="text-accent hover:underline font-medium">Little River-Academy</a>
          </li>
          <li class="mb-2 break-inside-avoid">
            <a href="/services/general-contracting-rogers-tx" class="text-accent hover:underline font-medium">Rogers</a>
          </li>
          <li class="mb-2 break-inside-avoid">
            <a href="/services/general-contracting-holland-tx" class="text-accent hover:underline font-medium">Holland</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-gray-600">
          Specialty:{' '}
          <a href="/services/kitchen-bath-remodeling-temple-tx" class="text-accent hover:underline">Kitchen &amp; bath — Temple</a>
          {' · '}
          <a href="/services/kitchen-bath-remodeling-killeen-tx" class="text-accent hover:underline">Kitchen &amp; bath — Killeen</a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Why Local Matters</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-700">
            <li>• Deep knowledge of Central Texas soil, weather, and building codes</li>
            <li>• Fast response for repairs and projects</li>
            <li>• Relationships with local suppliers and trades</li>
            <li>• Five generations of community roots and trust</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-deep-blue text-white p-8 rounded-2xl">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4 text-gold-primary">Ready to discuss your project?</h3>
          <p class="mb-6">Whether in Bell County or a surrounding area, we're ready to help.</p>
          <a href="/get-quote" class="inline-block bg-accent hover:bg-gold text-dark-blue font-bold px-8 py-3 rounded-lg">Request a Free Quote</a>
          <div class="mt-4">
            <a href="tel:2545813808" class="text-gold-primary hover:underline">(254) 581-3808</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>